OL,3,GNEWSASchools locked down after report
OL,4,Aof armed man
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools went into a temporary lockdown
OL,7,Fafter a report of a man seen with a
OL,8,Fweapon in a park, police have said.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to Cantley Park, Wokingham, on
OL,12,FMonday afternoon.
OL,14,FThe schools, which went into lockdown
OL,15,Fas a "precaution", had since reopened,
OL,16,Fand officers remained at the scene
OL,17,Fcarrying out extensive enquiries, the
OL,18,Fforce said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
